---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Support" description="Get installation help or report an issue with a Dealer AI plugin.">
  <article class="content-page">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> Support</div>
    <h1>Help with a plugin.</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>For installation problems, package defects, or workflow corrections, open an issue in the public source repository. Include the plugin name, the prompt you used, the result you expected, and what happened instead.</p>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/arielcoro/dealer-ai-plugins/issues">Open a GitHub issue</a></p>
      <h2>Before reporting</h2>
      <ul><li>Confirm you downloaded the latest ZIP from this marketplace.</li><li>Test the plugin in a new chat.</li><li>Remove customer personal information, credentials, and proprietary dealership data from examples.</li></ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
